+    Construct the `Cube` object. Sample the SDF at the 8 vertices of the cube:
+    $$ pos[v] = min + \{ (v\&1)*cubeSize.x, ((v>>1)\&1)*cubeSize.y, ((v>>2)\&1)*cubeSize.z \} $$
+    $$ sdf[v] = sdf(pos[v]) $$
