+    Calculate the intersection point using linear interpolation:
+    $$ \mu = \frac{isoLevel - sdf[i1]}{sdf[i2] - sdf[i1]} $$
+    $$ point = pos[i1] + \mu \cdot (pos[i2] - pos[i1]) $$
